# Milivoj, gravedigger of St. Andral's (docs/voice/milivoj.md). He sold the saint's bones to Henrik.

~ start
if flag.milivoj_confessed
-> after
endif
if not flag.milivoj_met
set milivoj_met
Narrator: A big young man in a sheepskin is digging a grave with a good deal more force than the earth requires. He doesn't look up.
Milivoj: Grave's not for you. Unless you keep standing on the edge of it.
elif attitude.milivoj == hostile
Milivoj [angry]: You. My collar's still creased. Grave's still not for you, but I've started measuring.
else
Milivoj: You again. Still digging. Still not for you.
endif
* Who's the grave for? -> grave
* [if flag.bones_theft_known] The saint's bones. You know where they went. -> accuse
* Goodbye. -> END

~ grave
Milivoj: Old Bogdana, from the lane by the lockup. Fever. That's what the priest wrote down, anyway. It's always fever, or wolves, or nobody knows. I dig the same size hole for all three.
interject tag:curious: Do you like the work?
Milivoj: It pays. Barely. Nothing else in this town pays at all.
-> start_menu

~ start_menu
* [if flag.bones_theft_known] The saint's bones. You know where they went. -> accuse
* Goodbye. -> END

~ accuse
Milivoj [angry]: Says who? The priest? He'd never say that. He wouldn't.
* [Insight DC 12] He's lying, and he's ashamed of it. -> insight_ok | insight_fail
* [Intimidation DC 13] Take him by the collar. -> scare_ok | scare_fail
* [Persuasion DC 13] Nobody's going to hang you. Just tell us the truth. -> plead_ok | plead_fail
* [if flag.lid_scrapes_found] Only someone who knew the trick of the lid could open it without breaking it. -> confess
* [if flag.henrik_confessed] Henrik already told us. Twenty gold, at night, for the saint. -> named
* [if gold >= 20] (Hold out twenty gold.) Henrik paid you twenty. We'll match it, for the truth. -> bought
* We'll be back. -> END

~ named
Narrator: He stops digging. He looks at the spade for a while, as if it might have an opinion.
Milivoj [sad]: Henrik. Of course Henrik. He couldn't keep a secret in a coffin.
-> confess

~ bought
gold -20
Milivoj: ...Twenty. Same as him. Funny how that's what everything in this town costs.
approve kip_smudgewick +1: You matched Henrik's price for the truth
-> confess

~ insight_ok
Narrator: He can't hold your eyes. His hands go white on the spade handle, and there's dirt under his nails that didn't come from this grave: it's pale and dry, like dust from a stone box.
Narrator: You say so. The fight goes out of him all at once.
-> confess

~ insight_fail
Narrator: He glares at you over the spade, and either he's honest or he's angrier than he is guilty. You can't tell which.
-> accuse

~ scare_ok
Milivoj [afraid]: All right! All right. Let go. I'll tell you.
approve thistle +1 liriel_dawnsong -1: You took a frightened gravedigger by the collar
-> confess

~ scare_fail
attitude milivoj hostile
Milivoj [angry]: Go on, then. Hit me. You'll have to dig your own hole after; I'm not doing it for free.
Narrator: He shrugs your hand off his collar and plants the spade between you, blade up.
-> accuse

~ plead_ok
Narrator: He looks at you a long while. Then he sits down on the edge of the grave and puts the spade across his knees.
-> confess

~ plead_fail
Milivoj: Nobody hangs in Vallaki. They go in the stocks and then they go hungry. I've done hungry. I'm not going back.
-> accuse

~ confess
set milivoj_confessed
quest bones_of_st_andral milivoj_confessed
Milivoj [sad]: I sold them. Henrik. The coffin maker. Twenty gold. He came to me at night, shaking all over, and asked for the saint by name. Said someone made him ask. I didn't ask who.
Milivoj: Twenty gold is a winter. I've got two brothers and a sister and a roof that leaks onto all of them. The saint's dead. They're not. That's how I did the sum.
interject class:cleric: That's a hard sum. I won't pretend it isn't.
interject name:kip_smudgewick: I know that sum. I did it myself, once, for my family. You don't stop doing it after.
* We won't tell Father Lucian it was you. -> shield
* Father Lucian deserves to know. -> no_shield
* [if gold >= 10] (Give him ten gold.) For your brothers and sister. -> kindness

~ shield
set milivoj_shielded
attitude milivoj friendly
Milivoj: You'd do that? Why?
interject tag:cheerful: Because you'll put it right yourself, one day. Won't you?
Milivoj: ...Yeah. Yeah, I will.
approve wren_featherfoot +2 kip_smudgewick +1 liriel_dawnsong -1: You kept Milivoj's secret from Father Lucian
-> END

~ no_shield
Milivoj [sad]: He does. He always does. Tell him I'm sorry. Tell him I'll dig for nothing till it's paid back.
approve liriel_dawnsong +1 godrick_pendlebrook +1 wren_featherfoot -1: You told Milivoj that Father Lucian deserves the truth
-> END

~ kindness
gold -10
attitude milivoj friendly
Milivoj: I don't... nobody gives anybody anything here. Thanks. Go and see Henrik. Go in daylight. Whatever's in his shop, it doesn't like daylight.
approve kip_smudgewick +2 godrick_pendlebrook +1 liriel_dawnsong +1 wren_featherfoot +1: You gave Milivoj gold for his brothers and sister
-> END

~ after
if flag.bones_returned
Milivoj: The saint's home, they say. I went down and looked. I put a candle by him. I didn't know what else to do.
elif flag.vallaki_backed == "neither"
Milivoj: Council's paying me to dig a ditch for the new latrines. First honest money in a year. Smells worse, pays better.
else
Milivoj: Did you go to Henrik's? Go in daylight.
endif
-> END
